<speak version="1.0" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2001/10/synthesis" xmlns:mstts="https://www.w3.org/2001/mstts" xml:lang="en-US">
  <voice name="en-US-NovaTurboMultilingualNeural">
    <mstts:express-as style="hopeful">
      <prosody rate="0.95" pitch="medium">
        <mstts:silence type="Leading" value="800ms"/>
        As we wrap up this journey through the lessons of <emphasis level="moderate">Rich Dad Poor Dad</emphasis>, remember—<emphasis level="strong">financial education</emphasis> is truly the foundation of wealth building.
        <break time="500ms" strength="medium"/>
        The choice is yours. Are you going to keep thinking like Poor Dad, working for money and living paycheck to paycheck? <break time="500ms" strength="medium"/>
        Or will you adopt <emphasis level="strong">Rich Dad's mindset</emphasis> and start building assets that work for you?
        <break time="500ms" strength="medium"/>
        The path to <emphasis level="moderate">financial freedom</emphasis> begins with changing how you think about money.
        <break time="500ms" strength="medium"/>
        <mstts:express-as style="cheerful">
          <prosody rate="1.1" pitch="medium">
            <emphasis level="strong">Take action today</emphasis>, and start your journey toward financial independence!
          </prosody>
        </mstts:express-as>
        <mstts:silence type="Tailing" value="1200ms"/>
      </prosody>
    </mstts:express-as>
  </voice>
</speak>